---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="CV / Resume | Jake Reddy"
  description="Software Designer & Enterprise Full-Stack Engineer specializing in .NET, Azure, Optimizely CMS, and Agentic AI architectures."
>
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:px-8">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header class="mb-12 pb-8 border-b border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] relative">
      <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-[#7c3aed] dark:bg-[#a78bfa] mb-6"></div>
      <p
        class="font-display text-xs font-bold text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] uppercase tracking-[2px] mb-2"
      >
        CURRICULUM VITAE • SOLITA
      </p>
      <h1
        class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight mb-4"
      >
        JAKE REDDY
      </h1>
      <p
        class="font-display text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-black dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4"
      >
        Software Designer & Enterprise Full-Stack Engineer
      </p>
      <p
        class="font-body text-base md:text-lg text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-6"
      >
        Enterprise-grade full-stack engineer specializing in .NET ecosystems, Azure cloud
        infrastructure, and complex system integrations, with emerging expertise in AI-assisted
        development and agentic AI architectures (GitHub Copilot, LangChain, RAG architectures).
        Proven track record architecting scalable solutions, leading cross-functional teams, and
        delivering mission-critical applications.
      </p>

      <blockquote
        class="border-l-2 border-[#7c3aed] dark:border-[#a78bfa] pl-4 py-1 italic font-body text-sm text-[#404040] dark:text-[#CCCCCC]"
      >
        "I enjoy viewing the big picture to help customers achieve their full potential value."
      </blockquote>
    </header>

    <!-- Key Strengths -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-black dark:border-white"
      >
        Core Strengths
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="border border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] p-5 bg-white dark:bg-[#181818]">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#7c3aed] dark:bg-[#a78bfa] inline-block mb-2"></span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Complex Integrations
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3]">
            X-Road government APIs, PIM systems, Azure Service Bus outbox pattern.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] p-5 bg-white dark:bg-[#181818]">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#7c3aed] dark:bg-[#a78bfa] inline-block mb-2"></span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Leadership & AI Enablement
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3]">
            Leading Tech Culture Boost AI agent workshops & developer mentorship.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] p-5 bg-white dark:bg-[#181818]">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#7c3aed] dark:bg-[#a78bfa] inline-block mb-2"></span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Customer Communication
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3]">
            Clear technical architecture guidance for enterprise stakeholders.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] p-5 bg-white dark:bg-[#181818]">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#7c3aed] dark:bg-[#a78bfa] inline-block mb-2"></span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Continuous Learning
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3]">
            Agentic AI workflows, Copilot, LangChain, RAG architectures, .NET 10.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Client Projects Showcase (Anonymized) -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-black dark:border-white"
      >
        Client Projects & Technical Engagements
      </h2>

      <!-- Recent R&D Project: Autonomous Flight & Mission Operations -->
      <div class="border-b border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] pb-8 mb-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">
            Autonomous Flight & Mission Operations Platform
          </h3>
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-semibold text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa]"
            >Confidential R&D Project</span
          >
        </div>
        <p
          class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-3"
        >
          Sector: Aerospace & Autonomous Systems R&D • Tech: Map-based Interfaces, Real-Time
          Behaviors, 3D & Video Telemetry, Protocol Buffers (Protobuf), NATS Stream State Management
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-[#404040] dark:text-[#CCCCCC] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Full stack software developer in a confidential R&D project focused on autonomous flight
          control, mission operations, and device maintenance in a high-requirement engineering
          environment as a core member of the R&D team.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 font-body text-sm text-[#333333] dark:text-[#CCCCCC]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Mission Planning & Control UI:</strong> Implemented demanding browser-based user
              interfaces for mission planning, real-time fleet operations, and maintenance of autonomous
              devices.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Geospatial, 3D & Video Interfaces:</strong> Developed interactive map-based telemetry
              visualization, real-time device behaviors, 3D spatial rendering, and video streaming integration.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>NATS & Protobuf Integration:</strong> Built backend integrations using Protocol
              Buffers (protobuf) for structured serialization and NATS stream-based state management for
              real-time telemetry processing.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Project 2 -->
      <div class="border-b border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] pb-8 mb-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">Public Procurement Platform & Data SDK</h3>
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-semibold text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa]"
            >05/2024 – 01/2026</span
          >
        </div>
        <p
          class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-3"
        >
          Sector: Government & Public Procurement Entity • Tech: Vue 2 → React, .NET 6, Azure (App
          Services, SQL Database, Service Bus, Key Vault), Schematron, Azure DevOps, AI Tools
          (Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude)
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-[#404040] dark:text-[#CCCCCC] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          National public procurement platform serving government entities and suppliers nationwide.
          Took technical ownership following vendor transition, maintaining system stability while
          modernizing core architecture.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 font-body text-sm text-[#333333] dark:text-[#CCCCCC]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Frontend Migration:</strong> Led Vue 2 to React migration for modern component
              architecture and developer experience.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Typed SDK (`hilma-sdk`):</strong> Architected typed SDK providing self-documenting
              data validation patterns and EU directive compliance rules.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Event-Driven Architecture:</strong> Implemented Azure Service Bus integration with
              transactional outbox pattern for guaranteed message delivery.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Schematron XML Validation:</strong> Implemented complex business rule validation
              engines for procurement notice workflows compliant with national law.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Project 2 -->
      <div class="border-b border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] pb-8 mb-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">
            Enterprise Banking Infrastructure & Security Hardening
          </h3>
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-semibold text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa]"
            >08/2023 – 02/2026</span
          >
        </div>
        <p
          class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-3"
        >
          Sector: Retail Banking & Financial Services Group • Tech: .NET 10, .NET 8, ASP.NET Core,
          Docker Compose, Azure (App Services, Key Vault), Azure DevOps YAML Pipelines, NPM
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-[#404040] dark:text-[#CCCCCC] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Infrastructure modernization, framework upgrades, and continuous security hardening for
          mission-critical third-party banking applications.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 font-body text-sm text-[#333333] dark:text-[#CCCCCC]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Framework Upgrade (.NET 8 → .NET 10):</strong> Executed framework migration, resolved
              breaking changes, and ensured full backward compatibility.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>One-Line Docker Setup:</strong> Architected complete local dev setup via Docker
              Compose with mocked third-party services for rapid E2E testing.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Health & Security Monitoring:</strong> Integrated StatusCake real-time health checks,
              Key Vault secret rotation, and automated dependency vulnerability scanning.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Project 3 -->
      <div class="border-b border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] pb-8 mb-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">Multi-Domain E-Commerce Platform Renewal</h3>
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-semibold text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa]"
            >01/2023 – 04/2024</span
          >
        </div>
        <p
          class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-3"
        >
          Sector: Food & Retail Enterprise • Tech: Optimizely DXP, .NET 6, ASP.NET Core, Razor, Vue
          3 (Composition API), Azure App Service, Azure AD SSO
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 font-body text-sm text-[#333333] dark:text-[#CCCCCC]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Data & PIM Integrations:</strong> Built real-time integrations with Product Experience
              Management (PIM) and live stock data sources.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Authentication Architecture:</strong> Architected multi-tenant OAuth 2.0 & OIDC
              solution supporting B2C/B2B user flows and Azure AD enterprise SSO.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Optimizely Search Optimization:</strong> Configured Optimizely Find with custom
              indexing, faceted search, and relevance tuning for product discovery.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Project 4 -->
      <div class="border-b border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] pb-8 mb-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">
            Government Identity Verification & X-Road Gateway
          </h3>
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-semibold text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa]"
            >03/2022 – 08/2022</span
          >
        </div>
        <p
          class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-3"
        >
          Sector: Savings Banking Group • Tech: .NET 6, React, Redux, Azure Bicep, Azure AD SSO,
          X-Road Data Exchange, SOAP, Azure API Management
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 font-body text-sm text-[#333333] dark:text-[#CCCCCC]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>X-Road Integration:</strong> Architected secure integration with Finnish Police
              API via X-Road data exchange layer with message signing and encryption.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="font-display text-xs text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mt-1">▸</span>
            <span
              ><strong>Infrastructure as Code:</strong> Provisioned complete Azure environment using Bicep
              templates and multi-stage YAML pipelines.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Work Experience -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-black dark:border-white"
      >
        Work Experience
      </h2>

      <div class="border-b border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] pb-6 mb-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-1">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold">Software Designer</h3>
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-semibold text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa]"
            >10/2021 – Present</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="font-display text-xs font-bold text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-3">Solita</p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-[#404040] dark:text-[#CCCCCC] leading-relaxed">
          Delivering enterprise custom software development, .NET and Azure cloud solutions,
          microservice integrations, and Optimizely CMS architectures across government, financial,
          and retail sectors. Member of Solita’s Tech Culture Boost unit leading internal AI agent
          enablement and training.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pb-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-1">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold">Manager</h3>
          <span class="font-display text-xs font-medium text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3]"
            >01/2019 – 04/2020</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="font-display text-xs font-bold text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-2">
          Hospitality Operations
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-[#404040] dark:text-[#CCCCCC]">
          Oversaw daily operations, inventory, team scheduling, and customer relations in
          high-volume environments.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Positions of Responsibility -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-black dark:border-white"
      >
        Positions of Responsibility
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="border border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] p-6 bg-white dark:bg-[#181818]">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Tech Culture Boost
          </h3>
          <p class="font-display text-xs font-semibold text-[#7c3aed] dark:text-[#a78bfa] mb-3">
            Solita • 08/2024 – Present
          </p>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] leading-relaxed">
            Active member organizing cultural initiatives and knowledge sharing. Leading internal
            training sessions on AI agent usage (Copilot, LangChain, RAG) and efficient development
            workflows.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] p-6 bg-white dark:bg-[#181818]">
          <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Chairman of the Board
          </h3>
          <p class="font-display text-xs font-semibold text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-3">
            Kuopion Kiipeilyseura • 01/2020 – 12/2022
          </p>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] leading-relaxed">
            Led board operations for Kuopio Climbing Association, initiated annual events, and
            developed digital presence, website, and community engagement.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Education, Certifications & Languages -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-black dark:border-white"
      >
        Education, Certifications & Languages
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="border border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] p-6 bg-white dark:bg-[#181818]">
          <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Education</h3>
          <p class="font-display text-xs font-bold mb-1">Highway 2 Code (MERN Full Stack)</p>
          <p class="font-display text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-2">
            Centria AMK & Univ. of Helsinki (01/2021 – 07/2021)
          </p>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3]">
            Full Stack Open program, React, Node.js, REST APIs, databases.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] p-6 bg-white dark:bg-[#181818]">
          <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
            Certifications
          </h3>
          <p class="font-display text-xs font-bold mb-1">Azure Fundamentals (AZ-900)</p>
          <p class="font-display text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3]">
            Microsoft • Issued 05/2022
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-[#E5E5E5] dark:border-[#333333] p-6 bg-white dark:bg-[#181818]">
          <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
            Languages & Passions
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-1">
            <strong>English:</strong> Native / Fluent
          </p>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3] mb-3">
            <strong>Finnish:</strong> Native / Fluent
          </p>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-[#525252] dark:text-[#A3A3A3]">
            <strong>Passions:</strong> Climbing, Outdoors
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
